Description "General Grievous

The fiendish leader of the Separatist Droid Army. Excels at close-range encounters as well as quick escapes.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Jedi Lightsabers (Dual)
-- Saber Defense (3)
--- BP Regen: 2/.4s
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- EX Saber Training (2)
-- Chain Limit: 6
-- 100% more special damage

^5Powers:
- Cyber Jump (1)

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Strength (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Cortosis (1)
- Melee Resist
- Armor Regen (1)
- Force Block (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- 30% less knockback taken
- 10% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"